WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.338
Week 22: Double Pronouns, Se, and Reference. report accidental events give concise instructions maintain reference across sentences

2
00:00:09.338 --> 00:00:17.417
Mission brief. Report three mishaps accurately, assign follow-up tasks, and avoid ambiguous pronoun references.

3
00:00:17.417 --> 00:00:27.035
Preparation. Select ten useful words, three linking expressions, and two repair phrases. Plan points rather than a memorized paragraph.

4
00:00:27.035 --> 00:00:35.051
Performance. Complete the task once for fluency, review the evidence, then repeat it for greater clarity and accuracy.

5
00:00:35.051 --> 00:00:43.791
After-action review. Record what succeeded, what blocked communication, and the single change that will matter most on the next attempt.

6
00:00:43.791 --> 00:01:12.951
Model language. Voy a informar tres percances con precisión. — I am going to report three mishaps accurately. Asigno una tarea de seguimiento a cada persona. — I assign a follow-up task to each person. Evito referencias ambiguas. — I avoid ambiguous references. Uso un lenguaje claro. — I use clear language. Cada persona sabe exactamente qué hacer. — Each person knows exactly what to do.

7
00:01:12.951 --> 00:01:23.105
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
